algorithms.pseudocode:
function TropicalEncode(A, x):
    for i = 1 to n:
        c[i] = min over j of (A[i,j] + x[j])
    return c

Complexity: O(n^2) time, O(n) space

function TropicalDecode(A, sigma, c):
    for j = 1 to n:
        i = sigma_inv(j)
        x[j] = c[i] - A[i, j]
    return x

Complexity: O(n) time, O(n) space

function TropicalKeyGen(n, delta):
    sigma = random_permutation({1,...,n})
    for i = 1 to n:
        base[i] = random()
        for j = 1 to n:
            if j == sigma(i): A[i,j] = base[i]
            else: A[i,j] = base[i] + delta + random_positive()
    return (A, sigma)

Complexity: O(n^2) time
